1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
How the laziest guy in our entire class got straight A's effortlessly.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,800
He never touched a physical highlighter or opened a single dense textbook during study hall.

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:19,500
His secret was scanning lecture slides and syllabi into VoiceReader, putting it on double speed while playing video games, and letting his auditory memory absorb all the exam material automatically.

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Is this pure academic genius, or is it completely unfair to everyone?
